    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcana Echo</strong> is a 2D puzzle game where you play as a young mage apprentice trapped inside an abandoned magic laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't run or jump \u2014 only think and cast. Discover ancient spellbooks to unlock new powers, like activating distant levers, levitating objects, and manipulating your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles based on classic physics elements like pressure plates, elevators, counterweights, and balance scales. Each room presents a new challenge, and each wing holds a different magical theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With silhouette art and a quiet, immersive atmosphere, <strong>Arcana Echo</strong> is a story of discovery, mystery, and the lingering echo of forgotten magic.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcana Echo</strong> is a 2D puzzle game where you play as a young mage apprentice trapped inside an abandoned magic laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't run or jump \u2014 only think and cast. Discover ancient spellbooks to unlock new powers, like activating distant levers, levitating objects, and manipulating your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles based on classic physics elements like pressure plates, elevators, counterweights, and balance scales. Each room presents a new challenge, and each wing holds a different magical theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With silhouette art and a quiet, immersive atmosphere, <strong>Arcana Echo</strong> is a story of discovery, mystery, and the lingering echo of forgotten magic.</p>",
